{"about_the_game":"Purino Party is a puzzle game which offers the player tons of freedom; As long as you do it within a certain amount of time, you're allowed to move the jewels anywhere you want! Experience a real sense of accomplishment as you create chains and rack up some serious points!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's an addictive tile-matching game crossed with what Japan does best: visual novels with cute girls you can fall in love with. It's the best of both worlds in casual gaming.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe way the game works is simple:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFirst, choose a girl you're interested in. After clearing each puzzle, you'll get to advance to the next scene or conversation with her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor every scene you complete, you'll unlock a new piece of artwork. All the ones you've unlocked can be viewed in the gallery at any time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features eight romanceable characters, with each route containing five chapters for your enjoyment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDon't worry if you can't clear a stage on your first try; the difficulty level can be lowered to make this game accessible even to beginners.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Turn Me On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/40cc1872b42eca7b870143bd17b6e26a295faf8b.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Warmed Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/363be85e578edf8bd7be6581dd29be387df66e8b.jpg"},{"name":"Fappable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/1fa05ec1e41aafd63ff92e7a8bfea78474bb981d.jpg"},{"name":"I Love You, Big Bro!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/33c14637aeb11329f8105623a22b405daafb44f5.jpg"},{"name":"Is This the Real Life? Is This Just Fantasy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/b00f66e772a39bc0cfd91d0e0bf1723947bc690f.jpg"},{"name":"Oh My Goddess!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/2ee8ca4235eedd96a96964d432f56027c563d999.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Girl Harem, Assembled!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/dbf86b3a2e63fec7167220464ef5cdbade337e49.jpg"},{"name":"Paint Me Like One of Your Purino Girls!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/5c28a13deb08f5a8c7356b173747ccfdbd170070.jpg"},{"name":"First Love Song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/81fc677182666367c4d7f800899471141329b8d5.jpg"},{"name":"Shining Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/483960/b4fab248ffa9e3318af01aa26a5084961ff56b8e.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/483960?t=1774920743","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/483960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774920743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/483960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774920743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/483960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774920743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Some Nudity or Sexual Content."},"detailed_description":"Purino Party is a puzzle game which offers the player tons of freedom; As long as you do it within a certain amount of time, you're allowed to move the jewels anywhere you want! Experience a real sense of accomplishment as you create chains and rack up some serious points!<br 